~ start
if Global.has_met_friend == false
	Friend: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], nice to meet you! I'm Diablo!
	Friend: Whatcha doing here?
	- Nothing...
		Friend: Okay, keep your secrets!
	- Just chilling
		Friend: Are you cold? Do you need a sweater?
	Friend: : Well, see ya soon I hope.
	set Global.has_met_friend = true
else
	Friend: Something else you need?
=> END